From d0e1763f9f558ab3a8b8cb21442c162151af49b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abhishek <abhishek01789@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 17:49:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 15/32] Port KWin's wobbly windows physics line for line

Use KWin's 4x4 spring grid with its default parameter set: stiffness
0.15, drag 0.8, move factor 0.1, 10 ms steps. The grab point is pulled
to the window, not pinned, and acceleration and speed are averaged over
the eight neighbours each step. Keep the 80% drag opacity.
